{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:beatsNoDayScreened", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "beatsNoDayScreened", "text": "No day in this window was screened", "sha256": "d3ba2f63817b20da62888595e4d9e41dd8b8043360742934cbb0ee887cf5c2ea", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:beatsScreenNote", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "beatsScreenNote", "text": "A screen, not a test.\n\nA day the screen did not fire is not a day you were cleared — it cannot rule anything out, and it never could. Outlined days were not screened at all: too few clean beats, or too much movement.\n\nWrist pulse is not an ECG. If symptoms are what brought you here, a clinician can test that properly.", "sha256": "b8f8301a1d605751dccd1971a2ad512ef16aa0bf1b2f824de5c77911f733cbee", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:beatsScreenedSummary", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "beatsScreenedSummary", "text": "{screened} of the last {win} days were screened", "sha256": "d46d6c9084f2ebb18d1b5c332b68fbb90838fcdbfd7b548334796ae53d6671e8", "kind": "arb"}
