{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:logWorkoutHardMinutesBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "logWorkoutHardMinutesBody", "text": "Detection reports the sustained effort it could see, so a warm-up and the rest between sets fall outside it. Adjust the times before logging if the window is short.", "sha256": "4a392a0bef52d12331629d14ef7da3152609e0bb645df9ebe094e76db4a01193", "kind": "arb"}
